    card title Travel

A: How do you say you're going somewhere by train, by bus or by plane, in Russian?
    draw masha masha_name

B: Lesson twenty-seven promised a verb for going by bus or train. Here it is: I meet Tom at the station.
    draw tom tom_name a_station bag

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

B: Tom has a train, so I asked куда́ ты е́дешь; I walk to work, so I said иду́. When something carries you, the verb is е́хать.
    highlight talk_1_words effect underline color #8f887c part едешь

    erase talk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name a_station bag

A: Here is е́хать: я е́ду, ты е́дешь, он е́дет, мы е́дем, вы е́дете, они́ е́дут.
    draw b_bus h_e e1 e2 e3 e4 e5 e6

B: Set it beside иду́ from lesson twenty-seven: the endings in blue match.
    draw b_walk i1 i2 i3 i4 i5 i6

A: But е́хать keeps its stress at the front, on е́, so there's no ё: идёшь, but е́дешь.
    highlight e2 effect underline color #8f887c part ^ед

    hide board_b

B: And what carries you? По́езд, the train; авто́бус, the bus; самолёт, the plane.
    draw v_train w_train v_bus w_bus v_plane w_plane

A: By train is на по́езде, as I said at the station.
    draw p_train

B: Like на вокза́ле in lesson thirty-four, it's на and an е: на авто́бусе, by bus.
    draw p_bus

A: And метро́, from lesson forty-two, never changes, like кино́: на метро́.
    draw v_metro w_metro p_metro

B: A plane flies, so for a plane Russians say лечу́: I fly.
    draw p_plane g_plane

    hide board_c

A: The whole trip: я е́ду в Москву́ на по́езде.
    draw d_train trip

    draw d_where d_how parallel true

B: В Москву́, where to, with the у of lesson twenty-seven; на по́езде, how, with на and е.
    blocking false

    highlight trip_w_4 effect underline color #3f7d4e part у$ duration 3

    highlight trip_w_6 effect underline color #d0865f part е$ duration 3

    hide d_train trip d_where d_how

    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: First I need a ticket. Masha plays the woman at the window.
    draw booth ticket

    draw talk3

    draw talk3

    erase talk3

    draw talk3b

    draw talk3b

    erase talk3b ticket booth

A: In Moscow, I need a гости́ница, a hotel. Masha plays the woman at the desk.
    draw desk hotel

    draw talk4

    draw talk4

B: Но́мер is the number from lesson six, стол но́мер семь. In a hotel, your room goes by its number, so но́мер is the room.
    highlight talk4_2_words effect underline color #8f887c part Номер

    erase talk4 hotel desk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: And in Moscow I'm в гости́нице: the а makes way for е, as шко́ла did, в шко́ле.
    draw f_hotel f_g

    hide page_f

    icon q_walk size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["man walking","walking"] icon_look picture of "person walking"

    quiz "Masha walks to work. Which verb? Я ___ на рабо́ту." reveal.text "Я иду́ на рабо́ту." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Four questions now, then your score.
        right: On foot, so иду́.
        wrong: Does anything carry her?
        * е́ду
        + иду́

    erase q_walk question_1_stamp

    icon q_bus size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["oncoming bus","trolleybus"] icon_look picture of bus

    ask "Tom takes the bus. Type the missing word: Я е́ду на ___." answer ["автобусе"] reveal.text "Я е́ду на авто́бусе." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Авто́бусе: на, and the е that says what carries you.
        wrong: Start from авто́бус, and add the е of на по́езде.

    erase q_bus question_2_stamp

    icon q_ticket size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["admission tickets","tickets"] icon_look picture of ticket

    quiz "A ticket to Moscow, please: Биле́т в ___, пожа́луйста." reveal.text "Биле́т в Москву́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Москву́: where to, so the а becomes у.
        wrong: The ticket takes you there. Where to, or where you are?
        + Москву́
        * Москве́
        * Москва́

    erase q_ticket question_3_stamp

    icon q_train size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["locomotive","high-speed train","railway car"] icon_look picture of train

    ask "Masha and her brother are going by train. Type the verb: Они́ ___ на по́езде." answer ["едут"] reveal.text "Они́ е́дут на по́езде." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 54 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Е́дут: the они́ form, ending in ут, like иду́т.
        wrong: Something carries them, so е́хать; and они́ ends like иду́т.

    erase q_train question_4_stamp

    show board_c

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 3

B: So on foot you say иду́, and when something carries you, е́ду.
    text recap "Я е́ду в Москву́ на по́езде." say "Я е́ду в Москву́ на по́езде." x 500 y 245 font_size 50

A: And one trip holds two little phrases: в Москву́, where to, and на по́езде, how.
    highlight recap effect underline color #8f887c part Москву

    hide board_c recap

B: And you? Куда́ вы е́дете? Счастли́вого пути́: have a good trip! Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 180 set twemoji x 300 y 450 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon end_tom size 180 set twemoji x 700 y 450 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man
    icon end_train size 100 set twemoji x 500 y 610 or ["locomotive","high-speed train","railway car"] icon_look picture of train
    text end_wish "Счастли́вого пути́!" say "Счастли́вого пути́!" say_voice b x 500 y 265 font_size 54
    parallel true

